# Git 提交信息（Source Control 自动生成）

When Cursor auto-generates a Git commit message for this repository:

1. MUST use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <subject>`
2. MUST write the subject (and body if any) in Simplified Chinese (简体中文)
3. NEVER write the commit subject entirely in English
4. Keep a single concise subject line; add a short Chinese body only when needed
5. Allowed types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert

Examples:
- feat(db): 交易日历冲突写入改为 bulkWrite
- fix(server): 修复 socket 断线后未自动重连的问题
- refactor(front): 抽取板块热度图表公共逻辑
